F]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Prompt-archive objects under files/objects are committed with the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]prompt that links them, the orphans already in the agents sidecar [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]clones get published by that same path, broken or unpublished [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]object links are reported, pre-existing dirt in a repository an [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]agent is not committing no longer blocks or invalidates `sase final[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]prepare`, and the raw-submit fallback can no longer commit the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]manifest template's placeholder message.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]agents_sidecar_orphan_objects.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/agents_sidecar_orphan_objects.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-196[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-196/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Commit prompt-archive objects with their prompts[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]archive-objects[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]archive-objects: stage files/objects in both prompt-archive commit [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]paths, never clean it, sweep hash-valid pending objects (including [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]today's orphans), and quarantine invalid ones. Pending objects must not [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]break the pre-commit pull.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Report unpublished and dangling archive objects[/bold #D7AFFF]  